('B1', 'reading-b1-1', 'A quieter morning', 'After moving farther from her office, Jo started cycling to the station instead of driving all the way to work. At first, she worried about arriving tired. However, the short ride made her feel more awake, and she could read on the train. Rainy days were less pleasant, so she kept a spare coat at work. She now spends less on transport, although the journey takes ten minutes longer.', 'What change did Jo make?', 1, '["She combined cycling with a train journey","She drove to a nearer office","She walked the whole way","She began working from home"]'::jsonb, 'She combined cycling with a train journey'),
