('B1', 'reading-b1-2', 'Repair before replacing', 'When the town opened a repair café, its organisers expected mainly older visitors. Instead, many young adults brought broken lamps, radios and bicycles. Volunteers helped owners repair the objects rather than doing all the work for them. Not everything could be saved, but visitors learnt useful skills. The café does not charge a fixed fee; donations cover tools and refreshments.', 'What surprised the organisers?', 1, '["No one brought objects","Only volunteers arrived","Visitors refused to learn","Many young adults attended"]'::jsonb, 'Many young adults attended'),
