('B1', 'reading-b1-3', 'An unexpected guide', 'On a school trip, our museum guide became ill just before we arrived. A retired engineer who volunteered at the museum offered to show us around. He knew less about the paintings than our usual guide, but his stories about the old machines were fascinating. We spent longer in that section than planned. Our teacher later asked us to compare this visit with the programme we had expected.', 'Why was there a different guide?', 1, '["The teacher cancelled the guide","The museum had closed","The original guide was ill","The class arrived a day early"]'::jsonb, 'The original guide was ill'),
