('B1', 'reading-b1-4', 'A different kind of challenge', 'Ravi joined a month-long reading challenge because he wanted to spend less time on his phone. The goal was to read twenty minutes a day, not to finish a particular number of books. He missed two days during a busy week and almost gave up. A friend reminded him that building a habit mattered more than a perfect record. By the end of the month, he was reading most evenings without checking the clock.', 'Why did Ravi join the challenge?', 1, '["To prepare a school exam","To reduce his phone use","To win a new phone","To read only long books"]'::jsonb, 'To reduce his phone use'),
