('B2', 'reading-b2-1', 'Measuring a shorter week', 'A software company tested a four-day working week without reducing salaries. Output remained stable, while reported stress fell. Managers initially called the trial an unqualified success. However, the trial coincided with a quieter sales period, and several employees admitted answering messages on their day off. The company extended the experiment into its busiest quarter and introduced a rule against routine contact on non-working days.', 'What does the new contact rule aim to protect?', 5, '["Employees'' non-working time","Managers'' access to staff at all times","The number of messages sent","The original sales forecast"]'::jsonb, 'Employees'' non-working time'),
('B2', 'reading-b2-2', 'A street for everyone', 'The council proposed removing parking spaces to create a protected cycle lane. Shop owners feared losing customers, but a survey showed that most shoppers arrived on foot or by bus. Nevertheless, the survey did not include early-morning deliveries. The revised plan retained two loading bays and added benches. A six-month trial would measure both business revenue and road safety before the council made the layout permanent.', 'What assumption did the survey challenge?', 1, '["That deliveries occurred early","That cyclists needed protection","That benches were expensive","That most shoppers needed car parking"]'::jsonb, 'That most shoppers needed car parking'),
('B2', 'reading-b2-2', 'A street for everyone', 'The council proposed removing parking spaces to create a protected cycle lane. Shop owners feared losing customers, but a survey showed that most shoppers arrived on foot or by bus. Nevertheless, the survey did not include early-morning deliveries. The revised plan retained two loading bays and added benches. A six-month trial would measure both business revenue and road safety before the council made the layout permanent.', 'What limitation did the survey have?', 2, '["It ignored all bus users","It measured only safety","It excluded early deliveries","It surveyed only drivers"]'::jsonb, 'It excluded early deliveries'),
