('B2', 'reading-b2-3', 'Who answers the survey?', 'A university asked students to complete an online survey about its new study spaces. Responses were overwhelmingly positive, but only twelve per cent of students replied. The library team suspected that frequent users were more likely to respond. Before investing in similar spaces elsewhere, it interviewed students who rarely visited the library. Many cited inconvenient opening hours rather than problems with the furniture or layout.', 'What limits the survey''s representativeness?', 1, '["The survey had no questions","The library was permanently closed","Only a small proportion of students responded","All students gave negative answers"]'::jsonb, 'Only a small proportion of students responded'),
('B2', 'reading-b2-3', 'Who answers the survey?', 'A university asked students to complete an online survey about its new study spaces. Responses were overwhelmingly positive, but only twelve per cent of students replied. The library team suspected that frequent users were more likely to respond. Before investing in similar spaces elsewhere, it interviewed students who rarely visited the library. Many cited inconvenient opening hours rather than problems with the furniture or layout.', 'Which group may have been overrepresented?', 2, '["Former students only","Frequent library users","Students who never studied","University staff only"]'::jsonb, 'Frequent library users'),
('B2', 'reading-b2-3', 'Who answers the survey?', 'A university asked students to complete an online survey about its new study spaces. Responses were overwhelmingly positive, but only twelve per cent of students replied. The library team suspected that frequent users were more likely to respond. Before investing in similar spaces elsewhere, it interviewed students who rarely visited the library. Many cited inconvenient opening hours rather than problems with the furniture or layout.', 'Why interview infrequent visitors?', 3, '["To understand views missing from the survey","To confirm every positive response","To advertise new furniture","To replace all existing staff"]'::jsonb, 'To understand views missing from the survey'),
